  "releaseNotes": "2.9.0 - Same engine as Cocos2D-Mono 2.9.0: the last nullable reference type annotations, fixes found while converting, and zlib through System.IO.Compression, with the bundled zlib port now obsolete. Read the CHANGELOG's Upgrading notes before updating.\n2.8.0 - Same engine as Cocos2D-Mono 2.8.0: more nullable reference type annotations, fixes found while converting, and gzip through System.IO.Compression. Read the CHANGELOG's Upgrading notes before updating.\n- See https://github.com/Cocos2D-Mono/cocos2d-mono for the full changelog.",
